## 3. Phase-by-Phase Sign-off Checklist

### Phase 1 Sign-off: Mathematical & Stochastic Foundations
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_distributions.py`: MLE parameter estimation recovers synthetic Gaussian, Student-t, Pareto parameters within statistical confidence.
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_sde_solvers.py`: Euler-Maruyama ($\mathcal{O}(\Delta t^{0.5})$) and Milstein ($\mathcal{O}(\Delta t)$) strong error slopes verified on 1D Geometric Brownian Motion.
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_ito.py`: Discrepancy $\left\| I_{\text{discrete}} - \frac{1}{2}(W_T^2 - T) \right\|_{L^2}$ converges as $\sqrt{T \Delta t / 2}$.
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_variance_reduction.py`: Antithetic and control variate variance reduction factors verified for benchmark parameters.
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_heavy_tails.py`: Hill estimator recovers synthetic Pareto tail index within $\pm 10\%$.
- [ ] `[DOC_REPRO]` Phase 1 test suite executes locally in $< 15$ seconds with deterministic seeds.

### Phase 2 Sign-off: Financial Engineering & Pricing Engines
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_black_scholes.py`: Closed-form call/put prices satisfy Put-Call parity within $10^{-12}$.
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_monte_carlo.py`: Monte Carlo price matches analytical BS call price for fixed seed; convergence rate verified.
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_mc_coverage.py`: Multi-trial 99% confidence interval coverage falls in $[96\%, 100\%]$.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_securitization.py`: Collateral cash-flow conservation holds strictly across all tranches and default scenarios.
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_time_series.py`: GARCH(1,1) model parameters fit within standard errors on synthetic ARCH paths.

### Phase 3 Sign-off: Statistical Learning & Kernel Methods
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_regression.py`: Ridge and Lasso shrinkage paths trace expected coordinate descent trajectories.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_kernels.py`: Mercer positive semi-definiteness verified for Linear, RBF, and Matérn Gram matrices ($\lambda_{\min} \ge -10^{-10}$).
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_gaussian_process.py`: Exact GP posterior mean matches noise-free synthetic function within $10^{-4}$.
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp03_volatility_forecasting.md`: Linear, SVR, GP, and TCN models benchmarked out-of-sample under walk-forward evaluation (CRPS, RMSE, and White's Reality Check reported).

### Phase 4 Sign-off: Modern AI, Transformers & Diffusion Scenario Generation
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_causality.py`: TCN and Transformer models pass zero-leakage causal gradient checks ($\partial y_t / \partial x_{t+k} \equiv 0$).
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_diffusion.py`: 1D temporal DDPM training loss decreases monotonically across epochs; output tensors are finite and non-NaN.
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp04_diffusion_stylized_facts.md`: Statistical fidelity of generated scenarios evaluated against empirical facts (kurtosis, volatility clustering); failure modes documented in registry.

### Phase 5 Sign-off: Bandits, Sequential Decision-Making & Reinforcement Learning
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_mab.py`: UCB1 and Thompson Sampling exhibit logarithmic cumulative pseudo-regret growth on stationary synthetic arms.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_environment.py`: Financial trading MDP deducts transaction costs strictly according to schedule.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_drl_portfolio.py`: PPO policy allocations project strictly onto the probability simplex ($\sum w_i = 1, w_i \ge 0$).
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp05_risk_sensitive_bandits.md`: Worst 5% drawdown and CVaR of risk-sensitive bandits (CVaR-UCB) compared against UCB1 under heavy-tailed return shocks.

### Phase 6 Sign-off: Robust Portfolio Optimization & Transaction Costs
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_convex_opt.py`: Markowitz solver verifies KKT conditions with primal feasibility gap $< 10^{-6}$.
- [ ] `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` `test_markowitz_analytical.py`: Numerical solution matches 2-asset analytical minimum variance weights within $10^{-7}$.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_transaction_costs.py`: Adding transaction cost penalty monotonically reduces portfolio turnover.
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp06_robust_vs_naive.md`: Robust Markowitz optimization compared out-of-sample against naive $1/N$ diversification under realistic transaction costs.

### Phase 7 Sign-off: Quantitative Research Protocol, EVT Risk & Scientific Validation
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_walk_forward.py`: Chronological walk-forward splits verified with purging and embargo windows.
- [ ] `[MATH_INVARIANT]` `test_leakage_guard.py`: Synthetic look-ahead injection triggers immediate automated test failure.
- [ ] `[STAT_VALIDATION]` `test_multiple_testing.py`: FDR and Bonferroni adjustments correctly control Family-Wise Error Rate on pure noise.
- [ ] `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` `exp02_evt_crash_backtest.md`: Kupiec POF and Christoffersen independence tests evaluated for unconditional and conditional EVT during 2008 and 2020 crash regimes.
- [ ] `[DOC_REPRO]` `test_reproducibility.py`: Identical random seed and config reproduce bitwise identical metric outputs on local machine.

### Phase 8 Sign-off: Unified Research Dashboard & End-to-End Suite
